{"track":"python","category":"기초 문법","level":1,"title":"두 수의 거리","desc":"<p>수직선 위의 두 점 <code>a</code>, <code>b</code> 사이의 거리(<b>절댓값</b>)를 돌려주는 <code>distance(a, b)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def distance(a, b):\n    pass\n","solution":"def distance(a, b):\n    return abs(a - b)\n","hint":"<p><code>abs()</code> 함수가 절댓값을 구해요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"distance(3, 10)","expected":7,"visible":true},{"call":"distance(10, 3)","expected":7,"visible":true},{"call":"distance(-2, 5)","expected":7,"visible":false},{"call":"distance(4, 4)","expected":0,"visible":false}],"id":"py-026"}